# Auto-generated, and there is no correct content to commit: the file gains or
# loses its "when@dev" shapes depending on which APP_ENV last booted the
# console, so `make qa` and opening the project leave it in opposite states. It
# had already ridden along in five feature commits before anyone noticed.
#
# Nothing here reads it. PHPStan analyses src and tests only, and what it
# provides is autocompletion for PHP-based configuration — this project's config
# is YAML and XML. It regenerates on the next console command if anyone wants it.
#
# The php-cs-fixer exclusion for it stays: that Finder walks the disk, not the
# index, so it still meets the file.
/config/reference.php
